---
title: Autostart at login
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Login
  participant Daemon
  participant Engine
  participant Registry
  participant CLI
  participant User
  Login->>Daemon: Start user service
  Daemon->>Registry: Read machine markers
  alt Globally paused
    Daemon->>Daemon: Skip automatic starts
  else Automatic starts enabled
    Daemon->>Registry: Begin login progress
    Daemon->>Engine: Backoff wait, ten-minute bound
    alt Engine unavailable
      Daemon->>Registry: Waiting, no boot claims
      Engine-->>Daemon: Later healthy observation
    end
    opt Routing already installed
      Daemon->>CLI: global up, no interaction
    end
    loop Unpaused projects in stable order
      Daemon->>Registry: Claim once per boot
      Daemon->>Engine: Inspect required services
      alt Confirmed stopped
        Daemon->>CLI: up -d in independent Linux scope
        CLI->>Registry: Lock instance, recheck intent
        CLI->>Registry: Recheck before containers start
        CLI-->>Daemon: Result without prompts
      else Running or unknown
        Daemon->>Daemon: Adopt or skip
      end
      Daemon->>Registry: Save result and progress
    end
    Daemon->>Registry: Finish login progress
  end
  User->>Registry: down publishes pause
  User->>CLI: Wait for instance lock
  CLI-->>User: Earlier startup settles
  User->>Engine: Stop project under lock
